stall-anything-static","content":"| Check              | Command                                                    |     |\n| ------------------ | ---------------------------------------------------------- | --- |\n| Native libs + CVEs | `apkanalyzer apk summary`, `unzip -l`; CVE mapping by hand | ~   |","table":"table-0"},"110":{"id":"/docs/checklist#19","page_id":"/docs/checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/checklist#1-before-you-install-anything-static","content":"| Check                                               | Command                                                           |     |\n| --------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------- | --- |\n| Cross-platform framework (Flutter/RN/Tauri/Cordova) | `find lib/ -name '*.so'`; Tauri = `libapp_lib.so` + remote web UI | ✔   |","table":"table-0"},"111":{"id":"/docs/checklist#20","page_id":"/docs/checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/checklist#1-before-you-install-anything-static","content":"| Check                       | Command                             |     |\n| --------------------------- | ----------------------------------- | --- |\n| Decompile for source review | `jadx-gui app.apk` (or `apktool d`) | ✔   |","table":"table-0"},"112":{"id":"/docs/checklist#21","page_id":"/docs/checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/checklist#1-before-you-install-anything-static","content":"| Check                        | Command                                                                     |     |\n| ---------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------- | --- |\n| Sideloaded/store differences | compare APKs from Play vs vendor — Play App Signing changes the signing key | ~   |","table":"table-0"},"113":{"id":"/docs/checklist#22","page_id":"/docs/checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/checklist#2-install-and-get-it-running","content":"| Check                            | Command                                                                                        |     |\n| -------------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | --- |\n| Get past root/emulator detection | `fspawn <pkg> intercept` (HTTP Toolkit set: root detection off, pinning off, proxy overridden) | ✔   |","table":"table-1"},"114":{"id":"/docs/checklist#23","page_id":"/docs/checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/checklist#2-install-and-get-it-running","content":"| Check                    | Command                                                                                    |     |\n| ------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ | --- |\n| Get past key attestation | `setup-keybox.sh` / `keybox-refresh`, target listed in `/data/adb/tricky_store/target.txt` | ✔   |","table":"table-1"},"115":{"id":"/docs/checklist#24","page_id":"/docs/checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/checklist#2-install-and-get-it-running","content":"| Check                   | Command                                          |     |\n| ----------------------- | ------------------------------------------------ | --- |\n| Get past Play Integrity | see Play Integrity — not passable on an emulator | ✘   |","table":"table-1"},"116":{"id":"/docs/checklist#25","page_id":"/docs/checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/checklist#2-install-and-get-it-running","content":"| Check                        | Command                                                 |     |\n| ---------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------- | --- |\n| Force the app to talk to you | `nettap on` (proxy + reverse + addon), then use the app | ✔   |","table":"table-1"},"117":{"id":"/docs/checklist#26","page_id":"/docs/checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/checklist#2-install-and-get-it-runni