checklist#31","page_id":"/docs/checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/checklist#3-runtime-storage","content":"| Check                | Command                                                                           |     |\n| -------------------- | --------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | --- |\n| Keystore-backed keys | `fspawn <pkg> attest` (`20-keystore.js` dumps subject/issuer of generated chains) | ✔   |","table":"table-2"},"123":{"id":"/docs/checklist#32","page_id":"/docs/checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/checklist#3-runtime-storage","content":"| Check                               | Command                              |     |\n| ----------------------------------- | ------------------------------------ | --- |\n| \"Keystore is hardware-backed\" claim | KeyAttestation app → see Attestation | ✔   |","table":"table-2"},"124":{"id":"/docs/checklist#33","page_id":"/docs/checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/checklist#3-runtime-storage","content":"| Check                   | Command                                                            |     |\n| ----------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------ | --- |\n| `adb backup` extraction | blocked on API 31+ unless the app opts in; use `pull-data` instead | ~   |","table":"table-2"},"125":{"id":"/docs/checklist#34","page_id":"/docs/checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/checklist#3-runtime-storage","content":"| Check                           | Command                                             |     |\n| ------------------------------- | --------------------------------------------------- | --- |\n| External storage / shared prefs | `pull-data` also pulls `/sdcard/Android/data/<pkg>` | ✔   |","table":"table-2"},"126":{"id":"/docs/checklist#35","page_id":"/docs/checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/checklist#4-runtime-network","content":"| Check                       | Command                                                                  |     |\n| --------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------ | --- |\n| Full request set, decrypted | `nettap on` + `flows` (files in `/tmp/mtflows`, index in `_index.jsonl`) | ✔   |","table":"table-3"},"127":{"id":"/docs/checklist#36","page_id":"/docs/checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/checklist#4-runtime-network","content":"| Check   | Command                  |     |\n| ------- | ------------------------ | --- |\n| Pinning | `fspawn <pkg> intercept` | ✔   |","table":"table-3"},"128":{"id":"/docs/checklist#37","page_id":"/docs/checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/checklist#4-runtime-network","content":"| Check                          | Command                                  |     |\n| ------------------------------ | ---------------------------------------- | --- |\n| Proxy-unaware / native traffic | same profile (in-process proxy override) | ✔   |","table":"table-3"},"129":{"id":"/docs/checklist#38","page_id":"/docs/checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/checklist#4-runtime-network","content":"| Check                       | Command                                                          |     |\n| --------------------------- | ---------------------------------------------------------------- | --- |\n| WebSocket / GraphQL over WS | flows capture the handshake; `cdp watch` shows app-side messages | ~   |","table":"table-3"},"130":{"id":"/docs/checklist#39","page_id":"/docs/checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/checklist#4-runtime-network","content":"| Check                      | Command                                    |     |\n| -------------------------- | ------------------------------------------ | --- |\n| Edit and re-send a request | `replay --grep PATH --patch 'field=value'` | ✔   |","table":"table-3"},"131":{"id":"/docs/checklist#40","page_id":"/docs/checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/checklist#4-runtime-network","content":"| Check                | Command                                                                                    |     |\n| -------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ | --- |\n| IDOR / authz testing | `snap list` → clone the AVD, log in as user B (`ANDROID_SERIAL`), replay user A's requests | ~   |","table":"table-3"},"132":{"id":"/docs/checklist#41","page_id":"/docs/checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/checklist#4-runtime-network","content":"| Check                    | Command                                                       |     |\n| ------------------------ | ------------------------------------------------------------- | --- |\n| MQTT/gRPC/QUIC/bluetooth | nothing here terminates those; check the app's protocol first | ✘   |","table":"table-3"},"133":{"id":"/docs/checklist#42","page_id":"/docs/checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/checklist#5-runtime-webview--hybrid-apps","content":"| Check                                      | Command                                                   |     |\n| ------------------------------------------ | --------------------------------------------------------- | --- |\n| DOM, localStorage, sessionStorage, cookies | `fdp` then `cdp eval 'location.href'` / `session harvest` | ✔   |","table":"table-4"},"134":{"id":"/docs/checklist#43","page_id":"/docs/checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/checklist#5-runtime-webview--hybrid-apps","content":"| Check                              | Command        |     |\n| ---------------------------------- | -------------- | --- |\n| Console + network of the web layer | `cdp watch 30` | ✔   |","table":"table-4"},"135":{"id":"/docs/checklist#44","page_id":"/docs/checklist","tags":[],"type":"text","url":"/docs/checklist#5-runtime-webview--hybrid-apps","content":"| Check                            | Command                                      